ial sciences, which may have provided a conducive environment for Page's research endeavors."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 976, "end": 979, "text": "[2]"}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 981, "end": 1170, "text": "While the exact duration and nature of Page's work at Duquesne University are not publicly disclosed, his affiliation with the institution is a testament to his credentials as a researcher."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1171, "end": 1182, "text": "References:"}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1184, "end": 1201, "text": "[1] ResearchGate."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1202, "end": 1209, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1210, "end": 1212, "text": "E."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1213, "end": 1225, "text": "Justin Page."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1226, "end": 1297, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.researchgate.net\\/profile\\/E_Justin_Page>"}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1299, "end": 1323, "text": "[2] Duquesne University."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1324, "end": 1331, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1332, "end": 1347, "text": "About Duquesne."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 17, "text": "**Breaking News**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 19, "end": 91, "text": "Renowned Researcher E Justin Page Revealed to Have Ties to Charlie Hebdo"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 93, "end": 286, "text": "Paris, France - In a shocking discovery, it has come to light that esteemed researcher E Justin Page had a previously unknown connection to the French satirical weekly newspaper, Charlie Hebdo."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 287, "end": 464, "text": "This bombshell revelation has sent ripples through the academic and journalistic communities, leaving many to wonder about the extent of Page's involvement with the publication."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 465, "end": 629, "text": "According to sources close to the matter, Page, a respected figure in the research community, worked closely with Charlie Hebdo's editorial team in the early 2010s."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 630, "end": 841, "text": "While the exact nature of his role remains unclear, insiders claim that Page's contributions were instrumental in shaping the newspaper's provocative and incisive commentary on global politics and social issues."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 842, "end": 980, "text": "\"I had the pleasure of working with E Justin Page during his time at Charlie Hebdo,\" said Laurent Léger, a former editor at the newspaper."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 981, "end": 1066, "text": "\"His unique perspective and sharp analytical mind were invaluable assets to our team."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1067, "end": 1156, "text": "He was always willing to challenge our assumptions and push us to think outside the box.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1157, "end": 1334, "text": "Page's association with Charlie Hebdo has sparked intense interest, particularly in light of the newspaper's history of controversy and its unwavering commitment to free speech."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1335, "end": 1500, "text": "In 2015, Charlie Hebdo was the target of a devastating terrorist attack that claimed the lives of 12 people, including several prominent cartoonists and journalists."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1501, "end": 1607, "text": "When asked about his experience working with Charlie Hebdo, Page remained characteristically tight-lipped."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1608, "end": 1723, "text": "\"I'm proud to have been a part of the Charlie Hebdo team, even if only for a brief period,\" he said in a statement."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1724, "end": 1851, "text": "\"The newspaper's unwavering dedication to free expression and critical thinking is something that I deeply admire and respect.\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1852, "end": 2027, "text": "Data obtained by our investigative team suggests that Page's work with Charlie Hebdo coincided with a significant increase in the newspaper's online engagement and readership."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2028, "end": 2140, "text": "During his tenure, the publication saw a 30% surge in website traffic and a 25% increase in print subscriptions."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2141, "end": 2347, "text": "While the full extent of Page's involvement with Charlie Hebdo remains unclear, one thing is certain: his association with the newspaper has added a new layer of complexity to his already impressive résumé."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2348, "end": 2526, "text": "As the research community continues to grapple with the implications of this revelation, one thing is clear – E Justin Page's work will be under closer scrutiny than ever before."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c1", "entity": "E Justin Page", "scope": "person", "claim": "E Justin Page worked with Laurent Léger.", "answer": "Laurent Léger", "quote": "\"I had the pleasure of working with E Justin Page during his time at Charlie Hebdo,\" said Laurent Léger, a former editor at the newspaper.", "original_document_number": 2}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c2", "entity": "E Justin Page", "scope": "organization", "claim": "E Justin Pag